re\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.fruitwins\"]],[\"qgJdGlsIAkoTCNqzm7HHkJcDFYw8gwMdnLojJPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCLwoTCg1jb20uZnJ1aXR3aW5zEAEYAxIYCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBABCgQICxAB\"],null,[null,\"Welcome to Fruit Wins! Begin Your Ultimate Blast-and-Win Adventure!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIn this lighthearted and enjoyable puzzle-shooting game, you can immerse yourself in a vibrant and juicy fruit paradise. Each shot delivers a satisfying matching experience. Whether you want to unwind during a short break or fully immerse yourself in some leisurely fun, this game offers fresh and exciting challenges for you to enjoy!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎮 Simple Controls, Smooth Matching\\u003cbr\\u003eJust tap to select your cannon and watch it auto-fire! Hit fruits to trigger chain reactions, quickly clear the screen, and become a master fruit matcher!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🔥 Quick Levels, Play Anytime\\u003cbr\\u003eEach level takes only a few minutes to complete. Whether it\\u0026#39;s after a meal, during your commute, or any time you need a moment to relax, you can dive into a refreshing and exhilarating matching feast anytime!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎯 Daily Challenges, Endless Surprises\\u003cbr\\u003eComplete daily missions, collect generous rewards, and continuously unlock new content. The more you play, the more surprises you’ll discover!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e👉 Ready for the hottest casual shooter of 2026? Download Fruit Wins now—load your cannon, blast the fruit, and conquer the fruity kingdom!\"],\"Buddyplay  Limited\",\"500+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/FjgLDAaoQVMU-Tng-zhIMso3AFWgVyFgwQvH1t0p6MIxT7nXEV8f5xlq8QtdQytD6YefLwsjWXsuANegRXbKaQ\"],null,[166,241,253,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play