id\\u003dorg.gg.crazy.brain\\u0026rdid\\u003dorg.gg.crazy.brain\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dorg.gg.crazy.brain\"]],[\"qgJiGmAILkoTCNqzm7HHkJcDFYw8gwMdnLojJPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCNAoYChJvcmcuZ2cuY3JhenkuYnJhaW4QARgDEhgKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAEKBAgLEAE\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Crazy Brain Puzzle is a fun and addictive brain test game packed with tricky puzzles, viral memes, and unexpected twists!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThink you’re smart? Put your logic, creativity, and observation skills to the test. Each level is designed to break the rules, challenge common sense, and surprise you in ways you never expected.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🧠 Challenge Your Brain\\u003cbr\\u003eSolve unique puzzles that require out-of-the-box thinking. The answers are never obvious!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e😂 Filled with Funny Memes\\u003cbr\\u003eEnjoy levels inspired by trending internet memes and real-life situations. Every stage brings something fresh and entertaining.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🔍 Find the Differences\\u003cbr\\u003eLook closely! Spot hidden differences between images, but don’t be fooled — things are not always what they seem.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🤯 Unexpected Solutions\\u003cbr\\u003eForget normal logic. Some puzzles are tricky, weird, and even absurd — that’s what makes them fun!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎮 Hundreds of Creative Levels\\u003cbr\\u003eA wide variety of levels keeps the gameplay exciting and never boring.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhether you\\u0026#39;re relaxing or looking for a real brain challenge, Crazy Brain Puzzle will keep you entertained and thinking!\"],\"Hainan Play Hi Cultural Entertainment Co., Ltd\",\"5,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_nR-fw0rwtX5D3ayFfUsIg2C56mqBre9uY9Ul2-t6fXzB