0],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/9MfQXAxqrBamk5XGCVqUnqG4qDP_5rw6lfwqimi-kFJaqVX_85aGTuQzd69991DUyBf0PEt1khXS7HbQURoFWSw\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/aR_ZbCGvP3tOFDuLgN0BeFFUepoTw7Iafr_TXAhOEsAlHJSJM8YSNM9UUuSzGC9L6zr0x3qOBp9Zy7t3O-quNlM\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/aWQQBiHx5_ORPUOx9En7bJs3ND_PzWdnk9Uooii6Bhi8QBXE4pQtMmrKFgIOa-OdIvhOzOwYr4IZ_xnIDHNu3A\"]]],\"Piano Cat: Music Games\",[\"4.0\",4.029126],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"PHP\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.piano.cat.rhythm.tiles.music.games\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.piano.cat.rhythm.tiles.music.games\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.piano.cat.rhythm.tiles.music.games\"]],[\"qgJ2GnQIPEoTCNqzm7HHkJcDFYw8gwMdnLojJPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCSAosCiZjb20ucGlhbm8uY2F0LnJoeXRobS50aWxlcy5tdXNpYy5nYW1lcxABGAMSGAoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAQoECAsQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Love cute tiles, music games, rhythm games, and piano games? Welcome to Piano Cat, an adorable cat music game where every tap plays beautiful songs with cute kitty cats. Follow the rhythm, hit every falling cat tile, and enjoy one of the most relaxing and addictive music games ever made.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhether you enjoy cute cat songs or casual arcade games, Piano Cat combines charming cats with satisfying rhythm gameplay. Every song features colorful cute tiles, smooth animations, and cheerful meow meow sound effects that make every performance even more fun.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePlay relaxing piano melodies, exciting pop hits, EDM tracks, and popular Kpop songs while improving your timing and reflexes. If you\\u0026#39;re looking for a fun piano game, an engaging rhythm game, or one of the cutest cat music games, Piano Cat is ready for you.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e⭐ Features\\u003cbr\\u003e🎵 Huge Music Library\\u003cbr\\u003e- Play piano songs, pop music, EDM, Kpop, and more.\\u003cbr\\u003e- New songs are added regularly so your music adventure never ends.\\u003cbr\\u003e🐱 Adorable Cats Everywhere\\u003cbr\\u003e- Unlock lovely kitty cats with unique styles.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Enjoy cute animations and funny meow meow sounds while you play.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Every song becomes more enjoyable with adorable feline companions.\\u003cbr\\u003e🎹 Fun Rhythm Gameplay\\u003cbr\\u003e- Tap falling cat tiles with perfect timing.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Hold long tiles and keep your combo alive.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Challenge yourself with faster songs and higher scores.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Easy to learn but rewarding to master.\\u003cbr\\u003e🌈 Relaxing Visuals\\u003cbr\\u003e- Bright and colorful cute tiles.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Smooth animations and beautiful effects.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Designed for a comfortable and enjoyable music experience.\\u003cbr\\u003e📶 Play Anytime\\u003cbr\\u003e- Enjoy one of the best offline games whenever you want.\\u003cbr\\u003e- No internet? No problem! Piano Cat is also one of the most fun no wifi games for music lovers.\\u003cbr\\u003e📚 How to Play\\u003cbr\\u003e🎵 Tap every falling cat tile as it reaches the target line.\\u003cbr\\u003e🎵 Hold long tiles until the note ends.\\u003cbr\\u003e🎵 Stay on the beat and don\\u0026#39;t miss any notes.\\u003cbr\\u003e🎵 Build long combos to earn higher scores and complete every song.\\u003cbr\\u003e🎵 Collect coins to unlock new kitty cats, songs, and rewards.\\u003cbr\\u003e🎵 Wear headphones for the best rhythm and music experience.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhy You\\u0026#39;ll Love Piano Cat\\u003cbr\\u003ePiano Cat brings together everything players love about cat games, music games, rhythm games, and piano games. The simple controls make it easy for beginners, while fast songs and challenging patterns keep experienced rhythm game fans entertained.\\u003cbr\\u003eIf you enjoy tapping cat tiles, collecting adorable kitty cats, or relaxing with beautiful cat songs, you\\u0026#39;ll always find something new to play. Fans of cute cat games, kitty cat games, cat piano games, and cat music games will love the combination of charming visuals, catchy music, and satisfying rhythm action.\\u003cbr\\u003eLooking for fun song games to pass the time? Want relaxing offline games you can enjoy anywhere? Prefer no wifi games during travel? Piano Cat lets you enjoy your favorite music wherever you are, even without an internet connection.\\u003cbr\\u003eWhether you\\u0026#39;re chasing Perfect combos, enjoying relaxing piano melodies, or mastering energetic Kpop and EDM tracks, every level offers a fun and rewarding challenge. With adorable cats, colorful cute tiles, exciting music, and addictive gameplay, Piano Cat delivers a fresh take on the classic piano game and rhythm game experience.\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload Piano Cat today, tap every cat tile, follow the rhythm, enjoy your favorite songs, and discover why so many players love cute cat games, relaxing music games, exciting song games, and addictive cat piano games all in one delightful adventure.\"],\"Agile Lion Games\",\"100,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/4mcO8uX_p5c9b8leXGZvKEQeNBGpiDPgIUVA41TqnQurZjnox3EbEQxrYa368_rsf7fU8GdYDfMNNRpqWyeo\"],null,[243,236,236,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"Suitable for all age groups. Some violence in a comical or fantasy context is acceptable. Bad language is not permitted.\"],[null,