sX1eQ\"]]],\"Arrow Smash: Earn Cash\",[\"4.6\",4.570922],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"PHP\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.arrowswishwin.aethernova\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.arrowswishwin.aethernova\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.arrowswishwin.aethernova\"]],[\"qgJsGmoIPUoTCNqzm7HHkJcDFYw8gwMdnLojJPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCPgoiChxjb20uYXJyb3dzd2lzaHdpbi5hZXRoZXJub3ZhEAEYAxIYCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBABCgQICxAB\"],null,[null,\"Welcome to Arrow Smash: Earn Cash, the minimalist puzzle game where logic, precision, and careful planning are your only tools. Every level presents a grid filled with arrows – your task is to extract them all, one by one, without ever causing a collision. It sounds simple, but each move matters. One wrong step and you lose a heart! Solve puzzles, earn rewards, and watch your cash grow.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGameplay Overview:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEach puzzle presents you with a grid of colorful arrows pointing in different directions. To solve the puzzle, you must tap and extract each arrow in the correct order, ensuring that no two arrows collide along their paths. As you progress, the grids grow larger, the paths become more complex, and your planning skills are pushed to the limit. Every successful clear earns you rewards – the smarter you play, the more you earn!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eKey Features:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSimple Yet Deep Mechanics: Easy to understand, but increasingly challenging to master. Every level requires careful thought and strategic sequencing.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEarn Real Cash: Solve puzzles and complete challenges to unlock real cash rewards. The more levels you clear, the more you earn!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThousands of Handcrafted Levels: Each level is meticulously designed to offer a unique challenge. With thousands of puzzles to solve, you\\u0026#39;ll never run out of brain-teasing fun.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMinimalist \\u0026amp; Clean Design: A distraction-free visual style that lets you focus entirely on the puzzle. Beautiful colors and smooth animations make every move a pleasure.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eRelaxing, No-Pressure Gameplay: No timers, no rushing, no stress. Play at your own pace and enjoy the satisfaction of solving each puzzle.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHint System: Stuck on a tough level? Use hints to get a gentle nudge in the right direction and keep progressing.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHeart System: You start each puzzle with a set of hearts. Make a mistake and lose one – clear the grid without losing them all to achieve a perfect victory and bigger rewards!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePerfect for Quick Sessions or Long Play: Whether you have five minutes or an hour, Arrow Smash: Earn Cash fits your schedule.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhy You\\u0026#39;ll Love It:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eArrow Smash: Earn Cash is the perfect game for players who love to exercise their brain without the pressure of timers or fast reflexes. It\\u0026#39;s just you, the grid, and the satisfying challenge of finding the perfect sequence. Every solved puzzle brings a sense of accomplishment and real rewards – and every mistake teaches you to plan better. It\\u0026#39;s calm, it\\u0026#39;s clever, and it\\u0026#39;s completely addictive.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload now and see if you can clear the grid without losing a single heart – and start earning today!\"],\"PT ANUGRAH KERTAS UTAMA\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/MbqTX2czxWSYEriLOyk8g6AbRHtzzpADoJomw_q-p3Ke7T6StS-4RpeatteL4x0u5onPSzY629NgkMc6gVCs\"],null,[69,48,34,255]],null,[\"Rated for 18+\