9aTKvr-eThKL1UsyLPXNHhRUZBKLYFWa-F0tcy02h06UGuIJlww5ea64X4R5T5zjZZT888BHgRA\"]]],\"Gacha Life 2\",[\"4.1\",4.1171875],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"PHP\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dair.com.lunime.gachalife2\\u0026rdid\\u003dair.com.lunime.gachalife2\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dair.com.lunime.gachalife2\"]],[\"qgJpGmcIPkoTCNqzm7HHkJcDFYw8gwMdnLojJPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCOwofChlhaXIuY29tLmx1bmltZS5nYWNoYWxpZmUyEAEYAxIYCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBABCgQICxAB\"],null,[null,\"★ Welcome to Gacha Life 2 ★\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThe sequel to your favorite dress-up game is finally here! Create your own anime styled characters and dress them up in your favorite fashion outfits! With more customization than ever, you can create any character that you can imagine! \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eChoose from thousands of dresses, shirts, hairstyles, weapons, and much more! After designing your characters, enter the Studio and create your own scenes and stories! Select from a hundred backgrounds to create the perfect story!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThe possibilities are endless! What are you waiting for? Download Gacha Life 2 and begin your journey today!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCREATE YOUR OWN CHARACTERS\\u003cbr\\u003e★ Dress up your characters with the latest anime fashion! Mix and match hundreds of clothes, weapons, hats, and more! Now with 300 Character Slots!\\u003cbr\\u003e★ Customize your personal look! Change your hairstyle, eyes, mouth, and more!\\u003cbr\\u003e★ Use the new Color Slider to choose from any color you want! Fully customize all your clothing!\\u003cbr\\u003e★ Adjust and rotate any item to any position on your character! \\u003cbr\\u003e★ Create your own custom poses and import and export your favorites!\\u003cbr\\u003e★ New items and more features that were never seen before in Gacha Life or Gacha Club!\\u003cbr\\u003e★ Set custom profiles for all your characters!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSTUDIO MODE\\u003cbr\\u003e★ Create your own scenes in Studio Mode! Enter custom text for your characters and choose from many different poses and backgrounds!\\u003cbr\\u003e★ Add up to 16 characters anywhere on the screen!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGACHA SIMULATOR\\u003cbr\\u003e★ Gacha for special preset characters to use in your stories!\\u003cbr\\u003e★ Collect and Gacha 400 unique characters to add to your collection!\\u003cbr\\u003e★ Free 2 Play forever!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e«Notes»\\u003cbr\\u003e- The game may lag on old devices. Set the game to Low quality and close other apps to reduce lag. Please restart the game if you experience lag over time.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThank you for playing Gacha Life 2!!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eOfficial Game Website: https://www.gachalife2.com/\\u003cbr\\u003eVisit our Company Website: https://www.lunime.com\"],\"Lunime\",\"10,000,000+\",null,null,null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/av9P80cD2jt3hffl5qubb7uPHXEcg9kp9RnZYlm6IOHTdruVp5dxvIUl6KSJQtZzPiubZNVbiHzKwl0JV-436Q\"],null,[179,199,227,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"Suitable for all age groups. Some violence in a comical or fantasy context is acceptable. Bad language is not permitted.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https:/