m7HHkJcDFYw8gwMdnLojJPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCNwobChVjb20ubWVyZ2VjYXQuaWRsZW1lb3cQARgDEhgKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAEKBAgLEAE\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Welcome to the coziest cat-merging experience yet!\\u003cbr\\u003eDive into a world where every cat is unique, and every match unlocks a new surprise. Spend Hearts to summon adorable kittens, then merge matching pairs to discover rare, evolved breeds and build the ultimate feline paradise!\\u003cbr\\u003e✨ Game Features\\u003cbr\\u003e🐾 Simple, Satisfying Gameplay Drag and drop two cats of the same level to evolve them into an even cuter, higher-level friend! The controls are intuitive and smooth, making it easy to jump in—while the addictive merge loop keeps you coming back for more.\\u003cbr\\u003e❤️ Collect Hundreds of Unique Cats Use Hearts to adopt a wide variety of breeds—from chubby orange tabbies and fluffy Ragdolls to mysterious black cats and stunning odd-eyed beauties. With hundreds of styles to collect, each featuring its own charming animations, you’ll want to find them all!\\u003cbr\\u003e🏡 Unlock Stunning New Environments As your collection grows, unlock breathtaking new backdrops for your cattery. Relax in a cozy countryside cottage, soak up the sun on a beach, explore a magical castle, or chill out in a whimsical treehouse. Each beautiful scene keeps your world fresh and inviting.\\u003cbr\\u003eReady to start your dream cat-collection journey? Create your own feline fairy tale through the magic of merging!\\u003cbr\\u003e📲 Download now and begin your purr-fect adventure today!\"],\"MYPMBA LLC\",\"500,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/0kNpDzGR-Hp-R2KnsxrGvwwc0tF8WUI2EFOVpCpx-SWN4o-wSyFBrKl_wdFcJtY7FJbpBOCTUspS6GXk5nxewA\"],null,[204,144,96,255]],null,[\"Rated for 18+\",[null,2,[366,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/QNpsl4k43vdbfwUAlVLZul2W5O5MUGOToystzghc97mljVHbUwtc639tahcuDsAVHdaGMyZA40AmMVcB_ws\"]],[null,\"Ca