d0tNRNNvvN0IgtxulKYxn-0rQjX_iw-6-T-9ftW6S71eTViQixkGFt1JAVGPU-LEF6LgoVDN0CGc\"]],[null,2,[1525,688],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ZBuKfxsicgvPZt2zyS_W2OFvgkziZGjRbnYGfNQuhitd-Mx9ogMUu7UXv4UPki6xVD9o2m28_AUlyc54Q_tlOw\"]],[null,2,[1525,688],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/28BHNiBy1UcuXinSq_OnN6iE6JdLFgH-tHjuJ9xNgbpkP6sZQTkazKLQcoxSLknmEJ66704oVidnbuk8RFhu\"]]],\"Puppet Bang! 2\",[\"4.3\",4.318182],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"PHP\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.puppet.bang.stress.relieve\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.puppet.bang.stress.relieve\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.puppet.bang.stress.relieve\"]],[\"qgJuGmwITkoTCNqzm7HHkJcDFYw8gwMdnLojJPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCQAokCh5jb20ucHVwcGV0LmJhbmcuc3RyZXNzLnJlbGlldmUQARgDEhgKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAEKBAgLEAE\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Had a long, rough day? Boss giving you a hard time?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePuppet Bang! 2is back with an even bigger, badder, and more satisfying smashing experience!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eStep into the ultimate ragdoll sandbox where rules don\\u0026#39;t exist and the helpless wooden puppet is your personal punching bag. Release your anger, relieve your stress, and indulge in pure, unfiltered chaos!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🔥 What’s New in Puppet Bang! 2?\\u003cbr\\u003e💥 Upgraded Ragdoll Physics\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eExperience hyper-realistic feedback! Feel every impact with improved ragdoll physics, snapping joints, and dramatic flying debris for maximum visual satisfaction.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🛠️ Massive Arsenal of Weapons\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFrom classic baseball bats and boxing gloves to explosive Gatling guns, thunder hammers, and sci-fi lasers! Unlock dozens of crazy tools and combine them for ultimate destruction.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎨 Custom Dummy Skins\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMake it personal! Dress up your puppet in hilarious outfits—turn it into a stressed office worker, a goofy clown, or a high-tech cyborg before you knock its socks off.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎧 Immersive Sound \\u0026amp; Impact Effects\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFeel the crunch with high-fidelity 3D impact sounds, hilarious puppet screams, and satisfying destruction audio. Put on your headphones for instant catharsis!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e⏱️ Pick Up \\u0026amp; Play Anywhere\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eNo complicated tutorials, no endless grinding. Jump right into the action in seconds whenever you need a quick mental break.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhat are you waiting for? Download Puppet Bang! 2 now and let the beatdown begin!\"],\"LNet Plus\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Z4WiQmWSxFG8fa6nuHuzCV3K6jSRMy7kwYfU_y1hsVV6IguHrS1j_KxdIHlhkSHpf2v17WAI_Opsh3Z4vtKHgAg\"],null,[250,185,107,255]],null,[\"Rated for 12+\",[null,2,[366,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/yQChfa9XKlaXMIYTk8w8QwChjT8_SH-_2d2SS-kesw0TLQK1nxtw54bDcoZ09freZJgKrtg4f__is-31Vg\"]],[null,\"Moderate Violence\"],null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/YrkR-GP7OKghBTATCoO_jJrchSVrh-NSUBb5DnbRZC1DbLK_cgV9FC2e_iI4GzLsKXuZjuFZajnGCiA8qA\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"PHP\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.puppet.bang.stress.relieve\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.puppet.bang.stress.relie