ll,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/QriU1loUxdRCVwkphfVdLNCr5VIYgySksA19viH5q8xTRk6iAEWP4FEr9vGBw3S4hoyhnleTgF35H-D5SPD2gz0\"]],[null,2,[1600,900],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/2w8S-37mqc91RVDDfqTBP0OQzCCj-8H41xMPXGMeJieGa2PyeNtpgPo9ylN3dbIv5tE0xvk6ksze3eE1BzMnkA\"]]],\"Spin Dreams\",[],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"PHP\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.spindreams.game\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.spindreams.game\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.spindreams.game\"]],[\"qgJdGlsIT0oTCNqzm7HHkJcDFYw8gwMdnLojJPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCLwoZChNjb20uc3BpbmRyZWFtcy5nYW1lEAEYAxISCgQIARABCgQIBBABCgQICxAB\"],null,[null,\"Join your Facebook friends and millions of players around the world to build village after village and complete the great journey along the Silk Road!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDo you have what it takes to be the next Dreamer?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSpin to Collect Game Resources\\u003cbr\\u003eSpin the wheel to collect riches to build your own village! You can also win bags of gold to construct magnificent villages throughout the game and conquer thousands of levels along the way.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSocial Interaction\\u003cbr\\u003eYou have the chance to attack other players’ villages, destroy their buildings, and hinder their progress in upgrading their villages; you also have the chance to steal other players’ gold treasures, slowing down their village construction. At the same time, don’t forget to win shields through the wheel—you’ll need them to defend your own village and prevent other players from striking back! Become a great visionary of the Silk Road.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBuild Your Village\\u003cbr\\u003eTo reach the great Silk Road, you must continuously collect in-game resources to build and upgrade your village. Experience different cultures and customs around the world, and see who can reach the finish line first!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eExciting Events\\u003cbr\\u003eMultiplayer tournaments, 7-day check-ins, limited-time gold boosts, and other rich in-game events bring you new surprises and fun every day.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSpin Dreams is available for free on all devices and has no in-app purchases.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMUST BE 18 YEARS OR OLDER TO PLAY. \\u003cbr\\u003eThis game is for amusement purposes only. It does not offer real money gambling. Past success here has no nexus to real money gambling.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFollow Spin Dreams on Facebook and YouTube for exclusive offers and perks!\\u003cbr\\u003eFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/SpinDreamsGame\\u003cbr\\u003eYoutube: https://www.youtube.com/@SpinDreamsOfficial\\u003cbr\\u003eTelegram: https://t.me/SpinDreamsGroup\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTerms of Service: https://www.spindreams.games/terms.html\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy Notice: https://www.spindreams.games/privacy.html\"],\"MegaFun Entertainmen\",\"100,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/nsfxw74vYllAW8jUWiPLA37HCP301dtCI5oyJ44ZgS8uAbm4b_W6pwDW8FsOZv4L5b7W4WMi8zoZq1T54KxZSg\"],null,[249,176,52,255]],null,[\"Rated for 18+\",[null,2,[366,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/QNpsl4k43vdbfwUAlVLZul2W5O5MUGOToystzghc97mljVHbUwtc639tahcuDsAVHdaGMyZA40AmMVcB_ws\"]],[null,\"Simulated Gambling\"],null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/stIOCymv1bYIi3UU_owFeyNt30CkUXbNlDj81ZWtjW9NBIMJxI47i_psYIr0Ho430Rm6mByCGNLORloB\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\