ARgDEhgKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAEKBAgLEAE\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"\\u003cb\\u003eNeed a quick break from stress? Start relaxing in seconds.\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eStress Relief - Relaxing Game brings together 40+ satisfying mini games, calming ASMR experiences, and soothing activities designed to help you unwind anytime, anywhere. Every activity is designed to help you relax and relieve stress after a busy day.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWash a dirty car until it shines. Clean stained carpets. Shape clay on a pottery wheel. Slice through kinetic sand. Pop bubbles, spin a fidget spinner, crack soap into tiny pieces, and discover dozens of relaxing experiences with soothing sounds and satisfying visual effects.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e40+ Relaxing Mini Games\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eExplore a growing collection of satisfying mini games and relaxing activities, including:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🚗 \\u003cb\\u003eCleaning Games\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e• Wash dirty cars until they sparkle\\u003cbr\\u003e• Clean stained carpets\\u003cbr\\u003e• Complete satisfying cleaning tasks\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎨 \\u003cb\\u003eCreative Games\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e• Shape pottery on a spinning wheel\\u003cbr\\u003e• Draw and doodle freely\\u003cbr\\u003e• Create simple, satisfying designs\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🔪 \\u003cb\\u003eCutting \\u0026amp; Slicing Games\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e• Slice kinetic sand\\u003cbr\\u003e• Carve soft candy\\u003cbr\\u003e• Cut vegetables with smooth, realistic motions\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🫧 \\u003cb\\u003eASMR \\u0026amp; Sensory Games\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e• Pop colorful bubbles\\u003cbr\\u003e• Spin a fidget spinner\\u003cbr\\u003e• Crack soap into tiny pieces\\u003cbr\\u003e• Squeeze stress balls\\u003cbr\\u003e• Watch Newton\\u0026#39;s Cradle swing\\u003cbr\\u003e• Crush objects for oddly satisfying effects\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🍳 \\u003cb\\u003eFun \\u0026amp; Relaxing Games\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e• Fry an egg\\u003cbr\\u003e• Play soothing xylophone melodies\\u003cbr\\u003e• Discover many more calming surprises\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eWhy You\\u0026#39;ll Love Stress Relief - Relaxing Game\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e• 40+ satisfying mini games in one app\\u003cbr\\u003e• Relaxing ASMR sounds and smooth visual effects\\u003cbr\\u003e• New activities added regularly\\u003cbr\\u003e• Simple one-touch controls\\u003cbr\\u003e• No timers, no scores, and no pressure\\u003cbr\\u003e• Perfect for quick breaks or longer relaxation sessions\\u003cbr\\u003e• Suitable for kids, teens, and adults\\u003cbr\\u003e• Play anytime, anywhere, even offline\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFrom cleaning games and sensory interactions to creative activities and satisfying ASMR experiences, every activity is designed to help you unwind, clear your mind, and enjoy a peaceful break at your own pace.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhether you\\u0026#39;re taking a short break at work, relaxing after school, or winding down before bed, Stress Relief - Relaxing Game is always ready whenever you need a few calm and satisfying moments.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eDownload Stress Relief - Relaxing Game today and discover 40+ satisfying mini games, soothing ASMR sounds, and relaxing experiences whenever you need a peaceful break.\\u003c/b\\u003e\"],\"HiveMind Games Inc.\",\"100,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/wgO5rZjaI3PR5ZaKRGqG4NA1MmtzwXqV4Gc7LihyjgLHQGwuaorc1eCCL2SwDQ_7Z7dhAIPfT0JLUmRSEfmC\"],null,[200,135,84,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgam