qgJmGmQIU0oTCNqzm7HHkJcDFYw8gwMdnLojJPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCOAoWChBjb20uaGlyb2JhLmhlbGl4EAEYAxIeCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBABCgQIBhABCgQICxAB\"],[[[null,null,\"4iuwXgrGL68\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:4iuwXgrGL68?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:4iuwXgrGL68\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezktoCHV3krdowTUTHFH6qvxRf1wwGDNKtIDsnsIzezdWaUHsdjyJ8q_1yfdoGplEm9I0ChcgEH7NdvFBYFD8f5EV81RYOjJ-t1tcGVIIOFN7GPVsDw8HFeBGybcOFrXzmCEDE2oulwdY73SlI934fUpTDXuDVHooDAHNv5zIKdE4euzoYjfIB-4KxSV_0gPQww0vd7OGN_szHgYcn1TWY3z0c1dxaSn1jxNMW8uy3WTjAa0im7w8dfxb8ZfEKcmoJcowFfx6W0CFQTUB78KlcfWvr8288BlCJmqwInbCXPI-g\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/4iuwXgrGL68/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Play Helix Stack Jump now, and enjoy this addicting arcade style drop game! Hyper casual time killer game that you can play for 5 minutes or 5 hours - download now!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e❗️Jumping ball awaits your command❗️ – blast, smash and bounce through helix platforms. Smash balls through colorful platforms that block your descent, but watch out - if you hit a black one it’s all over! Helix Stack Jump is easy to play, hard to master. Simple gameplay at first with hard challenges as you progress! Stack king legends are ready to be made.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBall falling addicting game - smash and blast through the helix stack. Ball falling strategy lets you launch the ball at full speed and create a fireball to smash through even unbreakable black platforms!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePlay offline, anywhere you go - this helix jump game is a great no wifi game. Fast ball game is exciting and addictive! Jump free and avoid the black to keep your ball falling all the way to the end. Block, fall down and crash through the helix platforms like no other game - it takes some serious skill to jump your ball to the end. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e💥Blast to the bottom💥! Simple One tap, easy-to-learn controls and amazing visual effects takes this casual game from awesome to epic!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload today and find your fast ball groove!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🤩 Helix Stack Jump Features:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCasual Game\\u003cbr\\u003e- One tap helix gameplay is easy to learn\\u003cbr\\u003e- Addicting game, hard to master\\u003cbr\\u003e- Jump game that is free to play\\u003cbr\\u003e- Helix games are fun for all ages\\u003cbr\\u003e- Hyper casual helix stack jump game\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAddicting Games 💪\\u003cbr\\u003e- Arcade game style jump helix game keeps you on your toes\\u003cbr\\u003e- Stack hit strategy will get you to the end\\u003cbr\\u003e- Smash ball through the helix tower\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePlay Offline\\u003cbr\\u003e- No wifi games keep you entertained wherever you are\\u003cbr\\u003e- Addicting game will hook you\\u003cbr\\u003e- Play offline anywhere\\u003cbr\\u003e- One tap and the helix game starts!\\u003cbr\\u003e- Free games for fun\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload this relaxing jump game today and stay entertained for hours! Easy and simple to start, a hard blast to the finish – challenge yourself to play every level!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eRead/write storage permissions is used for screenshots and cache user save files.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy: https://kooapps.com/privacypolicy.php\"],\"Kooapps Games | Fun Arcade and Casual Action Games\",\"50,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/PxX5d9K5SC9yj3kDr8XtMpKILYOZQxVjGenwpyXCElBMnv4OprPL6Nv_Cux3J1LOeLFVcT_lX-H1RFVNTZh8\"],null,[46,49,148,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googlepla