zA4FbEuZBMqgpC7MVEwpmZ-I2WrzicBpljg\"]],[null,2,[2450,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/JS3xALiqS9_jMOCPYcItfCQ51B4jvSzCzhPUgN45lmUkIFyTe7Habclr139plJdjjpszUcxppnD1HSPXyELHrw\"]],[null,2,[2360,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IjM-ixandSFb7ht3tArTjDEL5kf0c7Awf_HDrdRsJrKUIXTFhJhSeb-Pgm-SSUfqupfllYh3XDFW5G1eMBOeeg\"]]],\"FurrJam:Hop In!\",[\"4.9\",4.888889],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"PHP\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.furrjam.traffic.jamgame\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.furrjam.traffic.jamgame\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.furrjam.traffic.jamgame\"]],[\"qgJrGmkIVUoTCNqzm7HHkJcDFYw8gwMdnLojJPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCPQohChtjb20uZnVycmphbS50cmFmZmljLmphbWdhbWUQARgDEhgKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAEKBAgLEAE\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Hop in and clear the cutest traffic jam!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFurrJam:Hop In! is a fun and satisfying bus puzzle game where adorable furry passengers are waiting for the right ride. Your goal is simple: guide each bus through the loop, manage the traffic flow, and help every passenger hop in without causing a jam.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePlan your moves carefully. Every bus has a path, every stop has a crowd, and every traffic loop needs the right timing. Tap, sort, and clear the road as the puzzle gets trickier level by level.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCan you keep the bus flow smooth?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGame Features\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEasy to play, satisfying to master\\u003cbr\\u003eCute furry passengers and colorful buses\\u003cbr\\u003eSmart traffic jam puzzles with smooth loop movement\\u003cbr\\u003eRelaxing yet challenging bus flow gameplay\\u003cbr\\u003eNew levels with fresh layouts and clever timing\\u003cbr\\u003ePerfect for fans of casual puzzle, traffic, and sorting games\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIn FurrJam:Hop In!, every move matters. One wrong bus can block the road, but the right plan will make the whole traffic flow feel perfect. Watch the jam clear, send the buses forward, and enjoy the satisfying moment when every furry rider hops in.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhether you like bus games, traffic puzzles, loop challenges, or flow-style brain teasers, FurrJam:Hop In! gives you a cute and relaxing puzzle experience with just the right amount of challenge.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eClear the jam. Control the flow. Let every furry friend hop in!\"],\"EASY PLAY GAME TECHNOLOGY LIMITED\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/nqtO6DLZiytTHCOg_S1d3uZ247cMjB4ibJiOsixGvuaySOcdr4wVeYwkCBydEPuJ_1nr44SUgmjX78DFrt02jdI\"],null,[149,165,183,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"Suitable for all age groups. Some violence in a comical or fantasy context is acceptable. Bad language is not permitted.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"PHP\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.furrjam.traffic.jamgame\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.furrjam.traffic.jamgame\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null