EEAEKBAgLEAE\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Horror Multivers: Sandbox\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eUnleash your inner mad scientist in Horror Multivers: Sandbox, the ultimate ragdoll playground where chaos reigns supreme! This physics-based sandbox experience puts you in control of a vast arsenal of weapons, tools, and contraptions, all designed for maximum Ragdoll torment. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDive into a dynamic sandbox environment where you can experiment with everything from melee weapons like swords and axes to powerful firearms, explosives, and even bizarre machinery. Watch as the Sprank ragdolls react realistically to every impact, creating hilarious and often outrageous scenarios.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHorror Multivers: Sandbox offers endless possibilities for creative destruction. Build intricate traps, launch Sprank into the stratosphere, or simply enjoy the satisfying crunch of a well-placed explosion. With no objectives or limitations, the only limit is your imagination.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eKey Features: \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e    Ragdoll Physics: Experience realistic and hilarious ragdoll physics as you interact with the Sprank characters.\\u003cbr\\u003e    Sandbox Playground: Explore a vast and open sandbox environment, perfect for experimentation and mayhem.\\u003cbr\\u003e    Extensive Arsenal: Choose from a wide variety of weapons, tools, and machinery to inflict maximum damage.\\u003cbr\\u003e    Endless Possibilities: Create your own unique scenarios and unleash your creativity in this chaotic playground.\\u003cbr\\u003e    Sprank Characters: Interact with the lovable yet unfortunate Sprank ragdolls.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHorror Multivers: Sandbox is the perfect game for those who enjoy physics-based sandbox games and the satisfying chaos of ragdoll destruction. Download now and let the Sprank torment begin!\"],\"Isandares\",\"5,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"htt