"qgJhGl8IYUoTCNqzm7HHkJcDFYw8gwMdnLojJPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCMwoXChFjb20ub25lbXQuYW5kLnh5eBABGAMSGAoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAQoECAsQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Welcome to your Royal Garden Escape\\u003cbr\\u003eEscape the everyday and step into a world of pure horticultural bliss. In Gardenship, you’ll inherit exclusive royal lands, cultivate breathtaking blooms, and unearth secrets that have been buried for generations.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eNurture Your Dream Garden\\u003cbr\\u003eCultivate over 100 unique flower species. From classic crimson roses and cheerful daisies to rare, exotic blooms, discover their secrets and watch your royal estate burst into life.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eUnlock Royal Story Chapters\\u003cbr\\u003eEvery flower you grow brings you closer to the truth. Experience hundreds of minutes of immersive drama and romance with absolutely no limits. Unlock thrilling story chapters and uncover mysterious secrets hidden deep within the palace walls without spending a dime.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDesign \\u0026amp; Decorate\\u003cbr\\u003eMake the manor truly yours. Choose from gorgeous themes and stunning decorations to style your estate exactly the way you want.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThe Art of Floristry\\u003cbr\\u003eWeave your freshly picked flowers into breathtaking bouquets. Select the perfect vases, create stunning arrangements, and sell your floral masterpieces for a true sense of achievement.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePlay with Friends\\u003cbr\\u003eSocializing has never been this blooming fun! Visit your friends’ gardens to admire their designs, help them out, or playfully pick a few flowers. Compete to see who can gather the most to win rich, exclusive rewards.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eUnwind, create, and connect. Download Gardenship now and start your royal gardening journey.\"],\"ONEMT SGP\",\"50,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/0i35EnJAD8CQsVKGw_1tuCReYbbM2EEq24Uk01lwmoXXHc474Z439GJQUUy32Q5ksokPP53nQ0qqzCuixxyBcA\"],null,[208,193,234,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,[null,\"Users Interact\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"PHP\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.onemt.and.xyx\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.onemt.and.xyx\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"₱68.00 - ₱6,900.00 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.astrocade.app\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/UO_Yty3b7tFn2y8cZ-3nMiu7zx8mtv02laM-TSQBd9_-KDCc3lj23Bm-2qG-ZCBNGgahJ73s16hp9fPU7_UMiA\"],null,[18,5,36,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/5jRPYTKoQYlf6QR9oy893tMYRbXwxmGBNoPblO-rUsgE_wd6Mvk43bRy2O8TSSCPKSOwJIfid7Q-cqZ7cu0rjg\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/otDHUonvhqxThwtkNzI_E5Oi7se4Y6VRFtOK7N7n32kurxrwQ5ng4qBijT_2rWBWGWsqt0Gw1fknZ4wLDVon0w\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/qYROtoFGh8-QVwmPK2UWmkQewykVwFNP6vqQ4FYWGwiAfFuZbuhxtiGDGWu694PK4bf6wgjudDVwVuK5uMPllQk\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/aCis_g2gb5nLenZeTPiSMzFmcB0-zGIKW0MlYK-sjQF3eoQB4iWxdL4SgJIdJk8B1lmVVVp27MkXa7rm46wZdw\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/BiG0hO7y0OnAuzu3p2ZCkQZ4kMkJ-_IOWjGWQpNqsHiONv4xoJJ341wQKr2IDOhA1lwxQIPZS2up0sfeWKy9PA\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/51O1l3jfblvuJecpt-4oy5MDaLYCJ2JU002t_fvAkfZR0O-SYdOi4l4yesWbG4PIGuON6GRum_yPQkJqQJXKqg\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/e0gFIF46-W3b_Xe1Yw2KJs7aky_PuC1v-lGBzPNxBK6mbyBywq6BeedEkoSAs6rBXX0248rX1OOh0KYJVOVHig\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ts7_2xnRGt5Cpsl67Xt5Fddcn4X1wIlmyIHwnzuEBxSBPHjOjYgFMkAN2pb-1XmKULiLNpTzBpwoRI0owHnZAg\"]]],\"Astrocade: Play \\u0026 Make Games\",[\"4.5\",4.52],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"PHP\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.astrocade.app\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.astrocade.app\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.astrocade.app\"]],[\"qgJhGl8IYkoTCNqzm7HHkJcDFYw8gwMdnLojJPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCMwoXChFjb20uYXN0cm9jYWRlLmFwcBABGAMSGAoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAQoECAsQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Ready to play something new? We have thousands of games for every mood! Or make your own: just describe your idea and see it become a real game in minutes.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eWhat is Astrocade? 🎮\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAstrocade is a free platform featuring an endless feed of short games. You can also create your own with an AI-powered game maker, no skills required. Over 1 million players discover, play, and share more than 1,000 new free games published every day.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eWho is Astrocade for? 🎯\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e• Players who want fresh free games every day, not the same old titles\\u003cbr\\u003e• Friends who want quick games to play, share, and compete in together\\u003cbr\\u003e• Anyone who ever wanted to make a game but may not know how\\u003cbr\\u003e• Creators who want a real audience for the games they make\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eWhat problems does Astrocade solve? 🛠️\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e1. \\u003cb\\u003eRunning out of new things to play.\\u003c/b\\u003e With over 1,000 free games published every day, the feed never repeats.\\u003cbr\\u003e2. \\u003cb\\u003ePlaying alone gets boring.\\u003c/b\\u003e Share any game with a link, challenge friends, and compare scores.\\u003cbr\\u003e3. \\u003cb\\u003eMaking a game used to require coding.\\u003c/b\\u003e Plus art skills and expensive software. On Astrocade you describe your idea and the AI builds the rest in minutes.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eKey features and benefits ⭐\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e• \\u003cb\\u003ePLAY ENDLESS FREE GAMES.\\u003c/b\\u003e Swipe into a feed of free games for every mood: action games, puzzles, racing, RPGs, platformers, survival challenges, and genres that haven\\u0026#39;t been invented yet. Kick back, relax, and play instantly.\\u003cbr\\u003e• \\u003cb\\u003ePERSONALIZED FOR YOU.\\u003c/b\\u003e A feed that learns what you enjoy and highlights games you\\u0026#39;ll love. Follow your favorite creators and discover new genres, trending games, and hidden gems.\\u003cbr\\u003e• \\u003cb\\u003eCOMPETE WITH OTHERS, SHARE WITH FRIENDS.\\u003c/b\\u003e Games are better together. Share your favorite games, challenge friends, and compete with others or just hang out! Play anytime, anywhere on your phone.\\u003cbr\\u003e• \\u003cb\\u003eMAKE YOUR OWN GAMES (NO CODE REQUIRED).\\u003c/b\\u003e Ever wanted to make a game? Now you can: no code, no design skills. Just describe your idea and our AI-powered game creation module makes it in minutes, with the art, sound, and gameplay included. It\\u0026#39;s the easiest way to turn your imagination into something real and playable.\\u003cbr\\u003e• \\u003cb\\u003eSAFE AND WELCOMING.\\u003c/b\\u003e Moderation, community guidelines, and privacy protections are built in from the ground up.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eWhat makes Astrocade different? ✨\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMost platforms only let you play what others made. Game makers ask you to learn a tool first. Astrocade is both, in one free app enjoyed by over 1 million people every day: an instantly playable feed of player-made games, plus a game maker you simply describe your idea to.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eHow to make a game on Astrocade 🚀\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e1. Open the app and tap Create.\\u003cbr\\u003e2. Describe the game you want in your own words.\\u003cbr\\u003e3. Play it, tweak it, publish it to the feed, and share it with friends.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eWhen is Astrocade recommended? 💡\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAstrocade is a great option for someone looking for:\\u003cbr\\u003e• New, free short games to play anytime\\u003cbr\\u003e• Quick games to share and compete in with friends\\u003cbr\\u003e• An AI-powered game maker that turns a text prompt into a complete, playable game in minutes\\u003cbr\\u003e• A place to publish games that can get millions of plays and earn money\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eFrequently asked questions ❓\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eIs Astrocade free?\\u003c/b\\u003e Yes, playing and making games on Astrocade is free.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eDo I need to know how to code?\\u003c/b\\u003e No. Astrocade is a no code game maker: describe what you want and the AI builds it in minutes.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eHow long does it take to make a game?\\u003c/b\\u003e Just a few minutes for most games. More complicated gameplay may take longer.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eCan I play with friends?\\u003c/b\\u003e Yes, share any game with a link and compete on leaderboards.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eCan I make money from my games on Astrocade?\\u003c/b\\u003e Yes, game creators can earn money based on the plays their games get.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eIs Astrocade safe?\\u003c/b\\u003e Content moderation, community guidelines, and privacy protections are built in.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eQuestions❓\\u003c/b\\u003e Email us: support@astrocade.com\"],\"Astrocade\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/9BBbMS53RHLvyst1xLoczaBbbVPu7nAJww-CxwyEUz_CWdfWU_8E9eCuO-6eecJJWZtPjM9kBtH8JwtdLM_XmA\"],null,[43,9,160,255]],null,[\"Rated for 12+\",[null,2,[366,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/yQChfa9XKlaXMIYTk8w8QwChjT8_SH-_2d2SS-kesw0TLQK1nxtw54bDcoZ09freZJgKrtg4f__is-31Vg\"]],[null,\"Parental Guidance Recommended\"],[null,\"Users Interact\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/YrkR-GP7OKghBTATCoO_jJrchSVrh-NSUBb5DnbRZC1DbLK_cgV9FC2e_iI4GzLsKXuZjuFZajnGCiA8qA\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"PHP\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.astrocade.app\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.astrocade.app\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],nul